WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.759
She got him!

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.344
Listen.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:14.014
This kick is for Gloria.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.183
Sounds like the bones on your face
broke just now.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:20.270
Think of it as Gloria smashing your face.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.063
And this…

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.773
is also for Gloria!

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.944
Make mincemeat out of this bitch!

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.533
You plan on hiding again.

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.368
Well, you won't be able to.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:39.164
A sticker split your head in two.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.168
Remove this sticker,
and it returns to the original.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:47.213
The next hit is also for Gloria.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.509
And the one after that too.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.764
And so is the next one!

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.224
The next one too.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:00:59.684
They are all for Gloria!

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.144
This one,

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.188
and this one too!

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.106
Take this!

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:07.817
And this!

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.986
This, this, and this!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.030
This, this, this, and this!

00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:15.241
They're all for Gloria!

